125:In fact, by considering the relationship between the parameters $k$ and $k'$ in the parameterised reduction, it is sometimes possible to prove conditional lower bounds on the running time of any algorithm for a specific parameterised problem.  Assuming the exponential time hypothesis, a lower bound on the running time for any algorithm to solve the \textsc{Clique} problem is known.
