213:In this section we prove our technical results about the list edge chromatic number and list total chromatic number of graphs with bounded treewidth and large maximum degree, and then give linear-time algorithms to solve \textsc{List Edge Chromatic Number} and \textsc{List Total Chromatic Number} on graphs of bounded treewidth.  
